questions.question_text:
Write the vector $\underset{\sim}{p}$ shown below as a column vector.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.6]
\draw[step=1,gray!25,very thin] (-4,-2) grid (2,3);
\draw[<->] (-4.5,0)--(2.5,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.5)--(0,3.5) node[above]{$y$};
\foreach \i in {-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2} \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\i,0){$\i$};
\foreach \i in {-2,-1,1,2,3} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,\i){$\i$};
\draw[->,thick,blue] (-3,-1)--(1,2);
\node[above left,font=\scriptsize] at (-1,0.5){$\underset{\sim}{p}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
